\" id=\"SE-d618df4c-07de-484c-b083-2db99f9c2e37\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7d9e8dd6-63f9-497c-875b-5a690170238b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8bcab2a4-081e-4805-aea3-46547c6bce17\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0972d90d-e1b9-4e4c-9252-b2f892e98892\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-000ad5ba-0255-40eb-bef8-3b3ed7fdd1e6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-962a9f1c-3a3a-4dd3-b6be-8197bd39d530\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7712fcb2-21fd-4c86-998e-a30236888426\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1f91e21e-8505-4029-9797-b8714fb8b012\">근데 재밌는건 하는 분만 한다는 거다. 과제도. 영업도. 수익화도. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0fea7275-2ec7-4752-8fd9-902d29719cea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e570c494-a03d-4fa3-87dc-31831cd90954\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3d6374f3-94ca-4f89-a2d8-641ca2c040bb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-48baa37e-4aba-4442-9b6f-3b5253568a00\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3517fec4-74fe-4506-833c-8e75044522ef\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-081d6998-97d8-482d-93dd-2d3de75d5a22\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bdeac876-404a-4076-a718-8ddf724d262c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9f3142be-bc34-45d6-8596-0cf12e94bbaa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-721d6b61-f04a-45da-a1c7-f15cdf6e3293\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4c4fe3a0-59a3-4873-adb1-b97c735fa613\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8df097e6-939b-4905-9027-54eb28f19659\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-37658a62-1ade-48dc-b3f5-fe0f7cace021\">카페 활동도 마찬가지다. 매월 위너스클럽이라고 수익인증 한 분들을 위해 무료로 마케팅 스터디를 하고 있다. 해당 스터디에서는 카페 활동을 열심히 해주시면 스터디때 피드백을 드리고 있는데 매달 포프리님만 한다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c7477443-e8af-4e1d-abb2-8e84d7e85bbe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60367fc5-7ca5-448d-9817-8010cbaa1387\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d81af23-d708-4e85-9049-a65fffff0e6e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-95ee9cda-3af9-4c51-b3aa-1801389de6a0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70dff96b-4674-48f2-9874-c068dfe5f9ce\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-503b714f-d0ab-40da-84d6-76edbaecca00\">그리고 진짜 너무 감사한건 포프리님은 매번 위너스클럽 스터디 때마다 후기를 남겨주신다. 5개월동안 단 한번도 빠지지 않고 작성해주셨다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-10d0f18b-a358-489e-9f62-55f5683db408\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4677f9ac-13f7-4338-9f3a-f9fa0aebabbd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d34f7b85-dd5d-41f7-823c-c413f06e1f3b\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-componen